ENVIRONMENT NOTE THAT AFFECTS THE TEAM4 ORACLE
================================================================================
  The *_reference.cjs oracle pattern pins the Node runtime to v24.22.1 / V8
  13.6.233.17-node.58 / typescript 5.9.3. The host node is v26.8.2, so the pin
  fails on the host; the pinned runtime exists in the isolated oracle container.
  team4's media oracle (tests/fixtures/media_asset_library_reference.cjs) uses
  the same convention. The Rust consumers read the golden JSON from an
  env-var directory and skip cleanly when the golden file is absent.
